      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/33/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "AMENDMENTS TO THE STAMP ACT 1949 Commencement of amendments to the Stamp Act 1949"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/33/eng@/~chp_III__cl_17",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "17",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/33/eng@/~chp_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Chapter comes into operation on 1 January 2010. New section 72A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/33/eng@/~chp_III__cl_18",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "18",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/33/eng@/~chp_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Stamp Act 1949, which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Chapter, is amended by inserting after section 72 the following section: “Penalty relating to stamp certificates 72A. Any person who— (a) sells or offers for sale a stamp certificate; (b) fraudulently attaches a stamp certificate to an instrument other than the instrument for which the stamp certificate was issued; (c) fraudulently detaches a stamp certificate or fraudulently causes a stamp certificate to be detached from the instrument; (d) counterfeits, or knowingly performs any part of the process of counterfeiting, any stamp certificate issued by the Collector; (e) sells or offers for sale any certificate which he knows or ought reasonably to know to be a counterfeit of any stamp certificate issued by the Collector; (f) has in his possession any certificate which he knows to be a counterfeit of any stamp certificate, intending to use or dispose of it as a genuine stamp certificate in order that it may be used as a genuine stamp certificate; or (g) uses as a genuine stamp certificate knowing it to be a counterfeit of any stamp certificate, shall be guilty of an offence and shall be liable on conviction to a fine not exceeding five thousand ringgit.”. Amendment of First Schedule"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/33/eng@/~chp_III__cl_19",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "19",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/33/eng@/~chp_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Paragraph 6 under “GENERAL EXEMPTIONS” in the First Schedule to the principal Act is amended by inserting after the words “Central Bank” the words “, the Labuan Offshore Financial Services Authority”. Amendment of Second Schedule"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/33/eng@/~chp_III__cl_20",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "20",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/33/eng@/~chp_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Second Schedule to the principal Act is amended by inserting after item 21 the following item: ARTICLES OF ASSOCIATION AND “22 The Registrar of MEMORANDUM OF ASSOCIATION Companies”. OF A COMPANY"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/33/eng@/~chp_II__cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "hasPart": [
