      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 57 the following section: “Electronic medium 57A. (1) The Director General may allow any form prescribed under this Act to be furnished by any person or by any class of persons in an electronic medium or by way of an electronic transmission. (2) For the purposes of subsection (1), the conditions and specifications under which any prescribed form is to be furnished shall be determined by the Director General.”. Amendment of Schedule 2"
      }
