        "@value": "in the column “Rate of tax”, by deleting the word “Nil” appearing against item no. 5. Savings and transitional provisions"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/33/eng@/~part_II__chp_V__cl_57",
